* Shared models for the CV interface front-end simulations (ngspice).

* Behavioural OPA172-class op-amp (one section of OPA4172):
*   A0 = 1e6, GBW = 10 MHz, slew ~10 V/us, rail-to-rail output (0.35 V from rails),
*   output resistance 50 ohm, current limit ~65 mA, en = 7 nV/rtHz (2.96 k noise resistor).
.subckt OPA inp inn out vcc vee
Rnz nz 0 2.96k
Bin inx 0 V=V(inp)+V(nz)
Rin inp inn 10Meg
Bgm 0 n1 I=159u*tanh((V(inx)-V(inn))*1m/159u)
R1 n1 0 1G
C1 n1 0 15.9p
Bclamp n2 0 V=min(max(V(n1), V(vee)+0.35), V(vcc)-0.35)
* output stage only works with rails present; internal ESD diodes to the rails
Bout 0 out I=65m*tanh((V(n2)-V(out))/(65m*50))*((V(vcc)-V(vee)) > 5 ? 1 : 0)
Desdp out vcc DSI
Desdn vee out DSI
Iq vcc vee 1.6m
.model DSI D(Is=1e-14 N=1 Rs=5)
.ends OPA

* Schottky clamps (BAT54S) and rail protection (SS14 / 1N5819).
.model BAT54 D(Is=2e-7 N=1.04 Rs=2.1 Cjo=10p Bv=30 Ibv=100u)
.model SS14 D(Is=3e-6 N=1.1 Rs=0.04 Cjo=110p Bv=40 Ibv=1m)

* ADS131M04 analog input (gain 1): 330 k average input impedance, ESD to AVDD+0.3 / AGND-1.6.
.model DESD D(Is=1e-14 N=1 Rs=10)
.subckt ADCIN ain avdd
Rin ain 0 330k
Desdp ain avdd DESD
Vneg nneg 0 -1.0
Desdn nneg ain DESD
.ends ADCIN
